&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is the world leader in meal-kits and one of Germany&#39;s biggest and fastest growing publicly traded companies. Join the Hellofresh security team to help to maintain the highest security standards within the industry. In this role you will join the Cloud Security Team, which is responsible for providing infrastructure security solutions at scale through automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhance&lt;/strong&gt; the security posture of HelloFresh’s cloud infrastructure and services, hardening them against abuse and nefarious activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure&lt;/strong&gt; containers, CI/CD pipelines and implement guardrails for the developers aligned with the DevSecOps principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate&lt;/strong&gt; procedures and develop products to improve the Security posture of HelloFresh’s infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt; and operate scalable processes to provision cloud access and maintain least-privilege&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and train&lt;/strong&gt; your peers on the best practices in security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remediate &lt;/strong&gt;and validate security issues across cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious mindset, the eagerness to learn and a commitment to staying updated with the latest advancements and best practices in the field of security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work experience in a security domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in one or more programming or scripting languages (e.g. Python, GO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with one of the major cloud provider (AWS, Azure, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of cross-functional squads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good problem solving skills and the ability to troubleshoot and solve technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Embedded directly within our PPC team, this role drives customer acquisition across key online channels including SEA, Display, App campaigns, and Native Ads. Beyond core performance marketing, you will take full ownership of high-impact, cross-functional initiatives that bridge the Marketing department with broader company-wide teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Performance Marketing Manager, you will play a crucial role in developing and implementing high-impact marketing campaigns across all our international markets, covering various languages and products. From inception to execution, you will be responsible for delivering and scaling performance marketing campaigns to drive growth and maximize conversion rates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That means:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, plan, and execute compelling performance marketing campaigns to increase conversion rates and enhance brand awareness in alignment with our targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive performance marketing channels to effectively support the complete consumer funnel, ensuring efficient CPA within allocated budgets. Still you are always welcome to identify opportunities to scale further, challenging the status quo and budget restrictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI to further automate and optimise campaign management, embracing new opportunities coming up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategies for existing channels and explore new opportunities for media testing to optimise lead quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing leaders to oversee media planning, asset development, implementation, measurement, and reporting for Performance Marketing efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently present campaign strategies, results, and actionable insights to stakeholders at all levels of the business, up to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What distinguishes this position?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to see the direct impact of your work on the team&#39;s processes and the results we achieve. At Raisin, we value teamwork, enjoyment, and personal development, fostering an open and appreciative feedback culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5+ years experience in performance marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering impactful performance marketing strategies, campaigns, and optimisations, with the ideal candidate having worked in an agency setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven international experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An absolute must is the practical use of AI, specifically building gems or AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of the ad platforms and networks, Google (Search, Display, App and Performance Max), Microsoft Advertising (Search, MSAN), Apple Search Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of other ad platforms and networks, including Social Ads (e.g. Meta, LinkedIn, Reddit) and Native Ads (e.g. Outbrain).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to derive actionable insights from data and effectively communicate them to diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strategic thinking, translating quantitative and qualitative data into effective marketing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of customer segmentation and its application in media planning, buying, and campaign development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, results-oriented environment and manage multiple projects effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organisational skills, attention to detail, and a sense of urgency and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player with the ability to work autonomously and take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional technical experience with tracking technology (e.g., Google Tag Manager, Adjust or other marketing-related tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Google Looker as a business intelligence platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
