&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt Market/HOP is Wolt/Deliveroo’s owned and operated grocery business, focused on delivering the best customer experience through high-quality selection, strong availability, and fast delivery. As 1P continues to scale across multiple countries, we are looking for a Manager, Strategy &amp;amp; Operations to help drive sustainable topline growth and bottomline performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role works closely with the Head of Wolt Mart / HOP&amp;nbsp; and Regional General Managers (RGMs) to define strategic priorities, drive key growth initiatives, and ensure delivery of financial and operational targets. The person will act as a key partner to Marketing, Finance, Category Management, and other global functional teams, ensuring alignment between strategy, planning, and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines strategic thinking with strong execution ownership, requiring exceptional analytical skills, structured problem solving, and the ability to lead cross-functional initiatives across 30+ markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Business Performance Ownership (Topline &amp;amp; Bottomline)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Head of Wolt Market / HOP and RGMs to drive sustainable growth and profitability across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and manage topline (GOV, orders, basket size) and bottomline (contribution margin, EBITDA, cost efficiency) performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify performance gaps, diagnose root causes, and drive corrective actions across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build forecasting models and performance tracking frameworks to ensure visibility and accountability against targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Strategic Planning &amp;amp; Financial Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Finance on annual planning, forecasting, and target setting processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of long-term growth plans, investment cases, and strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment between financial targets and operational execution across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance vs plan and drive actions to close gaps where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Growth Initiatives &amp;amp; Marketing Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing to define and execute growth initiatives across acquisition, retention, and basket size expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize high-impact growth levers and ensure effective execution across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and evaluate impact of growth initiatives and continuously optimize based on performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of scalable playbooks to drive consistent growth across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Cross Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Category Management, Product, Operations, and other global teams to drive key strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects end-to-end, from problem definition to execution and impact measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable tools, processes, and operating models that enable strong execution across 30+ countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong alignment between global strategy and local market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Data, Analytics &amp;amp; Performance Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Looker, Excel, and other BI tools to analyze business performance and identify actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards, models, and performance tracking tools to support decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear insights and strategic recommendations for senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support experimentation and test-and-learn approaches to optimize performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of relevant experience in Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, management consulting, investment banking, tech companies, or high-growth retail/e-commerce environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in fast-paced, high-growth, and cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with financial planning, growth strategy, or operational performance management is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills with strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Excel, including financial modelling, forecasting, and scenario analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience using BI tools such as Looker to extract insights and drive decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data-driven mindset with ability to translate data into actionable business recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL experience is a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving &amp;amp; Strategic Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding structured problem-solving skills with ability to break down complex and ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify high-impact opportunities and prioritize effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment and ability to connect strategy with operational execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work closely with senior stakeholders, including General Managers and global functional leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills across global and local teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence without authority and drive alignment across multiple functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with demonstrated experience leading cross-functional initiatives end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and workstreams simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mindset with strong bias toward action and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a global, fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, proactive, and highly motivated individual with strong ownership mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Real Chemistry, making the world a healthier place isn’t just an aspiration—it’s our everyday reality. Our drive to transform healthcare is informed by our blend of deep scientific expertise, human-centred creativity, and AI-driven insights, fostering a unique environment where innovation thrives and our people are impact-obsessed. As a global agency, we provide a full suite of services across healthcare communications and marketing to our clients, including top players in the pharmaceutical and biotech industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our #LifeatRealChem culture is rooted in our people—we believe we are best together and are committed to excellence for both our clients and colleagues. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned professional or just starting your career, if you share our passion for healthcare and connection, we invite you to explore our opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover your purpose. Embrace innovation. Experience #LifeatRealChem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Medical Writer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Senior Medical Writers&lt;/strong&gt; are responsible for driving day-to-day project delivery (with support from others) within an account in order to create outstanding medical content across a variety of therapy areas. This position is ideal for an experienced writer who has a passion for scientific and medical developments, a keen interest in AI, and who enjoys tackling new problems, interacting with clients, and mentoring internal team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scientific knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently steps into new therapeutic areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starting to lead discussions with clients and external experts on therapy area, drivers which influence treatment decision-making and patient pathways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Helps to lead meetings and strategic discussions with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively utilizes a broad range of AI solutions to streamline complex projects, with support from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluates and implements AI-driven solutions to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of projects, identifying opportunities for improvement and collaborating with team members to optimize project delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides guidance and training to team members on best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads content delivery for complex projects with supervision from senior team, delegating to AMW/MWs as needed and where appropriate to ensure timely execution to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in achieving communications objectives by employing a broad range of channels and formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project development: &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interrogates briefs from clients/internal teams and proactively flags any queries or potential issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applies critical thinking skills towards a project brief to achieve deliverables in a timely and efficient manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides a proactive, solution-focused approach towards resolving queries, and addressing feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiates discussions with Account Teams regarding potential barriers to successful project completion that may arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editorial:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops compelling narratives from complex information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structures and writes novel projects that may not have been executed previously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality control:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes responsibility for overall quality of deliverables with supervision from senior team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviews JMWs’ work for adherence to brief, client objectives and quality of writing, providing constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On site: &lt;/strong&gt;Leads elements of the on-site programme across a variety of events with support from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client liaison: &lt;/strong&gt;Leads scientific discussion with clients and external experts as appropriate to capture briefs, resolve queries, and progress scientific content development in timely and efficient manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and new business&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports development of scientific content for new therapeutic areas for new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identifies new business opportunities with new and existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management: &lt;/strong&gt;Provides timely and accurate communication to accounts team on writer hours, and project progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;: Trains/mentors junior writers on account-specific therapy area knowledge and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications and skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should bring a strong scientific background with a degree in a scientific or medical discipline (post-graduate degree preferred). A high level of academic achievement is expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should bring previous experience of medical writing at an MW level or above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for, and profound understanding of, healthcare, science, medicine, and the pharmaceutical industry is essential, as well as a keen interest in AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll need to be personable, articulate, and capable of nurturing relationships. Previous experience mentoring MWs and interacting regularly with clients is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Real Chemistry offers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks. Learn more about our great benefits and perks at: http://www.realchemistry.com/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe we can do our best when feeling our best, which is why we’ve put together a benefits program designed to give you the support you and your family need at every stage of life. Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks, tailored to your region. Globally, this includes offices in our key markets with free snacks to keep you running all day long, generous holiday and paid time off, options for private medical, dental, and vison plans, and support in saving for the future. Other perks include mental wellness coaching and support&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;access to more than 13,000 online classes with LinkedIn Learning.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Learn more about our great benefits and perks and search specific offerings in your region at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.realchemistrybenefits.com&quot;&gt;www.realchemistrybenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;At Real Chemistry, we believe we&#39;re at our best when we&#39;re connected. Our Real Hybrid and Regional Teams (Real HART) approach is designed to foster collaboration, learning, innovation, and meaningful relationships while providing flexibility where appropriate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Because our workforce spans multiple countries, regions, and client needs, work arrangements may vary by role and location. Some positions offer hybrid or remote flexibility, while others require regular in-office presence. For example, certain teams and regions, including some of our UK operations, have office-based requirements. Your recruiter will discuss the specific expectations for the role you&#39;re pursuing during the interview process and keep you informed throughout the hiring journey.&amp;nbsp;For employees located within a one-hour commute of a Real Chemistry office, we require in-person attendance two days per week, either from a Real Chemistry office or when working onsite with clients. Employees in regions without a nearby office may work remotely and come together throughout the year for collaboration, culture-building, learning, and team connection opportunities.&amp;nbsp;While these guidelines reflect our current workplace model, we understand that everyone’s circumstances are unique. If you require additional flexibility, we welcome an open conversation with your recruiter and our HR team to discuss your needs and determine what may be possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is an Equal Opportunity employer. We continually strive to build and sustain an inclusive and equitable work environment where our employees feel empowered to leverage all they bring from their personal lived experience and professional expertise, to make our team the best in the industry. We encourage motivated and qualified applicants to apply without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, ethnic or national origin, age, physical or mental disability, genetic information, marital information, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local employment discrimination laws where Real Chemistry operates. Should you require accommodations throughout the interview process please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Notice: Real Chemistry and its affiliates&#39; names are being misused by scammers through messaging services, fake websites, and apps. Do not share personal or financial information or make payments to any unverified sources claiming to be connected to Real Chemistry. We are working to stop these unauthorized activities and protect our community. Read more&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.realchemistry.com%2Fscam-alert&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185967986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=vBa1KYjD6TUHgTF3FdPRQZvM8E8WUgHZqu9yHevh1%2BI%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Our Digital Streaming Partnerships team are responsible for Sony Music UK’s relationships with Spotify, Apple, Amazon, YouTube, Vevo, Deezer &amp;amp; SoundCloud. This is an exciting opportunity to get hands on experience in the inner workings of a major record label and how artists grow their audiences on these platforms, as well as an overall insight into the way in which a record label works on a day-to-day basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Streaming Partnerships Manager, you will work with all music genres and closely with all of Sony’s label groups (such as Columbia and RCA). You’ll manage our relationship with Spotify, helping to maximize visibility for our artist’s releases and shape bespoke marketing campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Management:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Proactively manage relationships with various label teams within Sony Music UK and manage the UK company&#39;s relationships with the platform. Act as the team point person for one of Sony’s key labels, attending their label meetings and fielding related questions from the label teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best Practice Education:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Drive education of internal teams on best practices for artist positioning, fan engagement, and growing audiences on the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artist Partnership Campaigns:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders to develop and execute bespoke artist partnerships with the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Meetings&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Plan and host regular in-person meetings to present and introduce our artists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Music Pitching:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Manage the pitch process of new releases and ongoing priority projects to ensure optimal visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within the music industry, digital music sector, or a related entertainment, media or technology business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Spotify, streaming strategy and the wider digital service provider (DSP) landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about music, culture and the ways fans engage with artists in a digital environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident relationship builder who can influence and collaborate with a wide range of internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded, with the ability to use data and insights to inform decisions and identify opportunities for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, with excellent time management skills and strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive self-starter who thrives in a fast-paced environment and can manage multiple priorities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An effective communicator and presenter, comfortable working with stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about emerging trends, technologies and innovations shaping the future of music and streaming.&lt;/li&gt;
