&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP integrations (especially NetSuite) and understanding of ecommerce supply chain workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical platform migrations and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing global (or similar scale) product roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
