&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt Market/HOP is Wolt/Deliveroo’s owned and operated grocery business, focused on delivering the best customer experience through high-quality selection, strong availability, and fast delivery. As 1P continues to scale across multiple countries, we are looking for a Manager, Strategy &amp;amp; Operations to help drive sustainable topline growth and bottomline performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role works closely with the Head of Wolt Mart / HOP&amp;nbsp; and Regional General Managers (RGMs) to define strategic priorities, drive key growth initiatives, and ensure delivery of financial and operational targets. The person will act as a key partner to Marketing, Finance, Category Management, and other global functional teams, ensuring alignment between strategy, planning, and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines strategic thinking with strong execution ownership, requiring exceptional analytical skills, structured problem solving, and the ability to lead cross-functional initiatives across 30+ markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Business Performance Ownership (Topline &amp;amp; Bottomline)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Head of Wolt Market / HOP and RGMs to drive sustainable growth and profitability across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and manage topline (GOV, orders, basket size) and bottomline (contribution margin, EBITDA, cost efficiency) performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify performance gaps, diagnose root causes, and drive corrective actions across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build forecasting models and performance tracking frameworks to ensure visibility and accountability against targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Strategic Planning &amp;amp; Financial Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Finance on annual planning, forecasting, and target setting processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of long-term growth plans, investment cases, and strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment between financial targets and operational execution across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance vs plan and drive actions to close gaps where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Growth Initiatives &amp;amp; Marketing Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing to define and execute growth initiatives across acquisition, retention, and basket size expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize high-impact growth levers and ensure effective execution across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and evaluate impact of growth initiatives and continuously optimize based on performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of scalable playbooks to drive consistent growth across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Cross Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Category Management, Product, Operations, and other global teams to drive key strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects end-to-end, from problem definition to execution and impact measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable tools, processes, and operating models that enable strong execution across 30+ countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong alignment between global strategy and local market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Data, Analytics &amp;amp; Performance Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Looker, Excel, and other BI tools to analyze business performance and identify actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards, models, and performance tracking tools to support decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear insights and strategic recommendations for senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support experimentation and test-and-learn approaches to optimize performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of relevant experience in Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, management consulting, investment banking, tech companies, or high-growth retail/e-commerce environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in fast-paced, high-growth, and cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with financial planning, growth strategy, or operational performance management is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills with strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Excel, including financial modelling, forecasting, and scenario analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience using BI tools such as Looker to extract insights and drive decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data-driven mindset with ability to translate data into actionable business recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL experience is a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving &amp;amp; Strategic Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding structured problem-solving skills with ability to break down complex and ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify high-impact opportunities and prioritize effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment and ability to connect strategy with operational execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work closely with senior stakeholders, including General Managers and global functional leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills across global and local teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence without authority and drive alignment across multiple functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with demonstrated experience leading cross-functional initiatives end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and workstreams simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mindset with strong bias toward action and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a global, fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, proactive, and highly motivated individual with strong ownership mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to own our search experience that millions of customers land on when they open DoorDash, Wolt, or Deliveroo, and the single biggest lever we have on what they find.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sits in our Core Consumer organisation in the Search domain, which is responsible for the in-app experience. You&#39;ll be building on a global stack, and your roadmap will be a mix: global platform problems that apply worldwide, global capabilities we&#39;re accelerating into EMEA markets, and EMEA-specific problems worth solving properly rather than working around.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Search is where customers tell us exactly what they want. Getting it right across restaurants, grocery, and retail - in every language we operate in - is one of the highest-intent and hardest problems in the app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll work on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query understanding, Autosuggestions and AI/ML problems in the Search domain&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where conversational and agentic search changes how customers get to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making search work across three brands, multiple languages, and query behaviour that differs market by market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a product leader more than a feature owner. Someone who can find the problems that matter most, for customers and for the business, and make the case for solving them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring proven experience as a Product Manager in Consumer, or on another relevance- or ranking-driven consumer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate fluency with search measurement and know how to actually move it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You show strong product judgment, backed by data literacy and customer insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work backwards from the customer problem, and you can weigh that against the most urgent business problems at the same time, rather than treating it as a side you have to pick.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think strategically: you can zoom out to where the domain should be in two years, then zoom back in on what we should ship next quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity and genuinely flexible. This industry is changing fast, AI most of all, and the plan we write in January won&#39;t be the plan in June.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work deeply with ML and engineering on relevance and ranking, without needing to be an ML expert yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about what AI actually changes for customers, and you can tell real value from hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build a case and bring people with you: engineering, design, analytics, and local market teams across three brands and many markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You do your best work with range: global platform thinking one week, a specific market&#39;s reality the next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be filled as soon as we find the right person, so make sure to apply as soon as you realize you really, really want to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
