&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Atlassian data model (Jira, Confluence, Jira Align, JSM Assets).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a software development agency, SaaS environment, or a setting requiring you to manage multiple stakeholders and shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
