&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harbor &lt;/strong&gt;is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to join our 3E Application Management team within our Legal Technology Enterprise Solutions practice group. Under general direction from the Change Team Lead, the Senior Associate Consultant will work closely with a team of skilled individuals from various technical and professional backgrounds, across multiple time zones, to ensure successful client engagements and consistent client satisfaction in continual improvement tasks. This is a position that can be hybrid London or Belfast in the United Kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;
