&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You command a room at any level.&amp;nbsp;Executive presentations, working sessions with skeptical users, hard conversations about scope and risk. You build trust fast and hold it under pressure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;relentlessly practical.&amp;nbsp;You care about what works in production and what changes client behavior, not what sounds impressive in a deck.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;comfortable with ambiguity.&amp;nbsp;Harbor Labs is&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;and the market is evolving.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;set&amp;nbsp;the playbook, not follow one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
